# Secrets of an installation. The "Deploy to Cloudflare" button asks for the values listed here.
#
# ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN: a password you choose, at least 16 characters. The first admin opens
# https://<address of the app>/einrichtung#<this value> once to set up their access.
ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN=
#
# Optional. Without them the app creates its own keys on first start (stored in the database,
# never in the export). Local development: npm run secrets:generate -- --dev writes .dev.vars.
# APP_SECRET=
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
